      "text": "· match inside furigana (skip rt / rp nodes)\n· inject into HTML attributes (use a TreeWalker,\n   not indexOf on markup — the inherited bug)\n· re-scan on every render (memoise per block+ETag)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "· match inside furigana (skip rt / rp nodes)\n· inject into HTML attributes (use a TreeWalker,\n   not indexOf on markup — the inherited bug)\n· re-scan on every render (memoise per block+ETag)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
